  "title": "Vitalis 晨报 · 今天安排：正常训练",
  "content": "<div style=\"max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px 12px 18px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#eef3f3;color:#14202b;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#0f3d3a;color:#ffffff\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#9fd3c9\">VITALIS · 晨报</p><h1 style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;color:#ffffff\">今天安排：正常训练</h1><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#c5e3dd\">2026-10-07 · 数据截至 2026-10-07 21:20 · 合成数据</p><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#d8f0e4;color:#0b5a33;font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">正常训练</span></p></div>\n<div style=\"margin:16px 0 0\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">关键记录</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#55636f\">睡眠时长</p><p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#14202b;word-break:keep-all\">7 小时 26 分钟</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 7px;border-radius:999px;background:#eef2f4;color:#4a5964;font-weight:600\">↓ 0.3%</span> <span style=\"color:#7a8892\">个人参照（近 28 日） · 7 小时 28 分钟</span></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#7a8892\">入睡 23:10；醒来 07:00</p></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#55636f\">静息心率</p><p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#14202b;word-break:keep-all\">61 次/分</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 7px;border-radius:999px;background:#fbede6;color:#a8431f;font-weight:600\">↑ 9.9%</span> <span style=\"color:#7a8892\">个人参照（近 28 日） · 56 次/分</span></p></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 140px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:#55636f\">HRV</p><p style=\"margin:2px 0 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#14202b;word-break:keep-all\">59 毫秒</p><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:0 7px;border-radius:999px;background:#e6f4ec;color:#127a3e;font-weight:600\">↑ 10.3%</span> <span style=\"color:#7a8892\">个人参照（近 28 日） · 54 毫秒</span></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#e2f1ee;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">今天的重点</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">主要安排：轻松跑 · 30–37 分钟 · 低强度</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">可选安排：拉类训练 · 40–60 分钟 · 中等强度</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">昨夜与今天</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#2b3a45\">静息心率高于个人基线</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">昨天的活动</h2>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">步数</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">11,502 步</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">活动距离</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">8.1 公里</span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"color:#55636f\">设备估算热量（统计范围待确认）</span> <span style=\"color:#14202b;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap\">534 千卡</span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dde6e9;border-radius:12px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#14202b\">昨天已记录的训练</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f4;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b3a45\">已记录步行：开始 10-06 12:30；时长 32 分钟；距离 2.40 公里；本次训练估算热量 120 千卡；平均心率 96 次/分钟</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#7a8892;text-align:center\">由 Vitalis 根据已保存数据生成，无需回复</p>\n</div>",
